sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Planner
    participant Shell as Browser shell
    participant Client as GraphQL client
    participant HTTP as HTTP app
    participant Exec as GraphQL executor
    participant Repo as Repository
    participant Store as JsonStore

    Planner->>Shell: open #/orders/PO-2026-1025
    Shell->>Client: gql(DETAIL_QUERY, { poNumber })
    Client->>HTTP: POST /graphql + bearer token

    Note over HTTP: CORS, rate limit, body limit,<br/>optional constant-time token check
    HTTP->>HTTP: parse, depth guard, validate

    alt invalid or too complex
        HTTP-->>Client: 200 { errors[] }
        Client-->>Shell: throw GqlError
        Shell-->>Planner: role="alert" + retry action
    else valid
        HTTP->>Exec: execute(document, context)
        Exec->>Repo: order(poNumber)
        Repo->>Store: read in-memory state
        Store-->>Repo: order + supplierId
        Exec->>Repo: supplier, lines, shipments, traceability
        Repo->>Store: indexed lookups through request loaders
        Store-->>Repo: related records
        Exec-->>HTTP: data + errors
        HTTP-->>Client: JSON + requestId
        Client-->>Shell: data
        Shell-->>Planner: accessible detail, focus h1
    end
